    # Phase 2: blocked symmetric rank-k update
    #          C := C + alpha * A * A^T   on j <= i.
    # ----------------------------------------------------------
    # We keep i as the outermost loop so that each row of C is
    # updated independently. For each row i we:
    #   - tile the reduction dimension k by TILE_K to improve
    #     locality over A[i, k] and A[j, k],
    #   - tile the j dimension by TILE_J so we work on short
    #     contiguous segments C[i, j],
